# Principles backend

ASP.NET Core WebAPI for the Principles habit/goal app. Flutter client lives in the sibling `flutter-frontend-of-principles` repo (this folder is nested as `backend/` in the multi-root workspace).

## Domain

- **Users / profile** — auth, slogan, mission, road-guide flag. `User.UpdatedAt` is the profile sync stamp (`LastModified` on bootstrap/profile = `UpdatedAt ?? CreatedAt`)
- **Goals** — user goals (`goal` schema)
- **Habits** — progress, frequency, reminders, areas of life (`hbt` / `arlf`)
- **Tasks** — one-off work with schedule/reminders/repeat; checklists in `tsk.TaskSubtasks`
- **Sync** — `GET api/sync/bootstrap` (+ ping) for client catch-up (includes AI conversations and the same reminder lists as `GET api/reminder/all`)
- **Reminders** — `GET api/reminder/all` remains for clients that only need reminders; bootstrap also returns `GeneralReminders` + `UserHabitReminders`
- **AI** — `POST api/ai/chat`, parse-task, title; conversations CRUD under `api/ai/conversations`; `AI_API_KEY` stays server-side only

## Client contract

- Prefer camelCase JSON DTOs in `SET.WebAPI/Models`
- Nested task `subtasks`: `null`/omitted = keep existing rows; empty array = clear
- Completing a subtask does **not** complete the parent task
